{"seq":2,"slug":"lut-carry-chain","title":"查找表与进位链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-architecture/lut-carry-chain","wordCount":1976,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"查找表与进位链\">查找表与进位链</h1><p>查找表（Look-Up Table, LUT）和进位链（Carry Chain）是 FPGA 可配置逻辑块中两个最关键的微架构组件。LUT 负责实现任意组合逻辑函数，进位链则提供专用的快速算术运算路径。深入理解这两者的工作机制对于编写高效的 HDL 代码和优化资源利用率至关重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LUT 与进位链代表了 FPGA 微架构中两种截然不同的设计哲学：LUT 用<strong>存储换通用性</strong>——把任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 变量布尔函数的真值表预先存下，查表即得结果，因此延迟与函数复杂度无关；进位链用<strong>专用换速度</strong>——为算术运算中必然出现的进位传播单独修一条物理通路，绕过通用互联的开关矩阵延迟。两者的分工决定了综合工具的行为边界：复杂但无规律的逻辑交给 LUT，有规律的算术交给进位链。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>判断一段逻辑落在哪条路径上，看它是否可被表达为&quot;位与位之间的进位传播&quot;——<code>+</code>、<code>-</code>、比较、计数器都会自动映射到进位链。</li>\n<li>LUT 的输入数（LUT4 → LUT6）是通用性与面积之间的折中，越宽越能压缩级联深度。</li>\n<li>进位链只在<strong>垂直方向</strong>沿列级联，因此宽位宽运算的资源消耗与布局强相关。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"lut-深入解析\">LUT 深入解析</h2><h3 id=\"lut-的本质-可编程真值表\">LUT 的本质：可编程真值表</h3><p>LUT 的核心思想极其简洁：将布尔函数的所有可能输出预先计算并存储在一个小型 SRAM 中，运行时通过输入信号作为地址直接查表获得结果。这种&quot;空间换时间&quot;的方法使得任意组合逻辑函数的执行延迟都是固定的——仅取决于 SRAM 的读取时间。</p>\n<p>对于一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 输入的 LUT：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储深度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 比特</li>\n<li>可实现任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 变量布尔函数（共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{2^k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0119em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0119em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.927em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种可能的函数）</li>\n<li>查表延迟固定，与函数复杂度无关</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"从-lut4-到-lut6-的演进\">从 LUT4 到 LUT6 的演进</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>LUT4</th>\n<th>LUT5</th>\n<th>LUT6</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入数</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储位数</td>\n<td>16 bits</td>\n<td>32 bits</td>\n<td>64 bits</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可实现函数数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>65536</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{16} = 65536</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65536</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>4.3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{32} \\approx 4.3 \\times 10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>64</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>19</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{64} \\approx 1.8 \\times 10^{19}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">64</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">19</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>面积（相对）</td>\n<td>1×</td>\n<td>2×</td>\n<td>4×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表架构</td>\n<td>Spartan-3</td>\n<td>Cyclone V</td>\n<td>7 系列/UltraScale</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现代主流 FPGA 采用 LUT6 架构的原因：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>减少级联深度</strong>：复杂逻辑用更少的 LUT 实现，缩短关键路径延迟</li>\n<li><strong>双输出模式</strong>：一个 LUT6 可配置为两个独立的 LUT5，共享输入但独立输出</li>\n<li><strong>分布式存储</strong>：LUT6 的 64-bit SRAM 可直接用作分布式 RAM 或移位寄存器</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"lut6-的双输出模式\">LUT6 的双输出模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph LUT6双输出模式&#10;        I1[&quot;输入 A1-A5&quot;] --&gt; LUT5a[&quot;上半 LUT5&lt;br/&gt;32-bit&quot;]&#10;        I1 --&gt; LUT5b[&quot;下半 LUT5&lt;br/&gt;32-bit&quot;]&#10;        LUT5a --&gt; O5[&quot;输出 O5&quot;]&#10;        LUT5b --&gt; MUX[&quot;2:1 MUX&quot;]&#10;        LUT5a --&gt; MUX&#10;        A6[&quot;输入 A6&quot;] --&gt; MUX&#10;        MUX --&gt; O6[&quot;输出 O6&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph LUT6双输出模式\n        I1[\"输入 A1-A5\"] --&gt; LUT5a[\"上半 LUT5&lt;br/&gt;32-bit\"]\n        I1 --&gt; LUT5b[\"下半 LUT5&lt;br/&gt;32-bit\"]\n        LUT5a --&gt; O5[\"输出 O5\"]\n        LUT5b --&gt; MUX[\"2:1 MUX\"]\n        LUT5a --&gt; MUX\n        A6[\"输入 A6\"] --&gt; MUX\n        MUX --&gt; O6[\"输出 O6\"]\n    end</pre><p>当第 6 个输入（A6）用作 MUX 选择信号时，O6 输出完整的 6 输入函数；同时 O5 可独立输出一个 5 输入函数。这使得单个物理 LUT 在某些情况下可以执行两个独立逻辑函数，将实际利用率提升近 2 倍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"lut-作为分布式-ram\">LUT 作为分布式 RAM</h3><p>在 SLICEM 类型的 Slice 中，LUT 可重配置为分布式 RAM，提供比 Block RAM 更低延迟的小容量存储：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置方式</th>\n<th>容量</th>\n<th>端口</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单口 RAM</td>\n<td>64×1 / 32×2</td>\n<td>1R1W</td>\n<td>FIFO 缓冲、小型查找表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双口 RAM</td>\n<td>64×1 / 32×2</td>\n<td>2R1W</td>\n<td>多读端口寄存器文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四口 RAM</td>\n<td>64×1</td>\n<td>4R1W</td>\n<td>多路并行读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移位寄存器（SRL）</td>\n<td>32-bit 深</td>\n<td>串行</td>\n<td>固定延迟管道、CRC 计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分布式 RAM 的读取延迟约 0.5 ns（纯组合逻辑路径），远低于 Block RAM 的 1-2 个时钟周期延迟，特别适合需要单周期读取的小容量存储场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"进位链-carry-chain\">进位链（Carry Chain）</h2><h3 id=\"算术运算的瓶颈\">算术运算的瓶颈</h3><p>在纯 LUT 实现中，一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 位加法器的最高位进位需要经过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 级 LUT 的级联延迟。对于 32 位加法器，这意味着 31 级 LUT 延迟，总传播时间可能超过 15 ns——在 200 MHz 时钟下完全不可接受。</p>\n<p>进位链正是为了解决这一瓶颈而设计的专用硬件结构。它提供一条物理上直接连通的进位传播路径，绕过通用互联网络的开关矩阵延迟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"进位链结构\">进位链结构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Slice内的进位链&#10;        CIN[&quot;Cin 进位输入&quot;] --&gt; CC0[&quot;进位单元 0&quot;]&#10;        CC0 --&gt; CC1[&quot;进位单元 1&quot;]&#10;        CC1 --&gt; CC2[&quot;进位单元 2&quot;]&#10;        CC2 --&gt; CC3[&quot;进位单元 3&quot;]&#10;        CC3 --&gt; COUT[&quot;Cout 进位输出&quot;]&#10;&#10;        LUT0[&quot;LUT 0&lt;br/&gt;生成/传播&quot;] --&gt; CC0&#10;        LUT1[&quot;LUT 1&lt;br/&gt;生成/传播&quot;] --&gt; CC1&#10;        LUT2[&quot;LUT 2&lt;br/&gt;生成/传播&quot;] --&gt; CC2&#10;        LUT3[&quot;LUT 3&lt;br/&gt;生成/传播&quot;] --&gt; CC3&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Slice内的进位链\n        CIN[\"Cin 进位输入\"] --&gt; CC0[\"进位单元 0\"]\n        CC0 --&gt; CC1[\"进位单元 1\"]\n        CC1 --&gt; CC2[\"进位单元 2\"]\n        CC2 --&gt; CC3[\"进位单元 3\"]\n        CC3 --&gt; COUT[\"Cout 进位输出\"]\n\n        LUT0[\"LUT 0&lt;br/&gt;生成/传播\"] --&gt; CC0\n        LUT1[\"LUT 1&lt;br/&gt;生成/传播\"] --&gt; CC1\n        LUT2[\"LUT 2&lt;br/&gt;生成/传播\"] --&gt; CC2\n        LUT3[\"LUT 3&lt;br/&gt;生成/传播\"] --&gt; CC3\n    end</pre><p>每个进位单元包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生成信号（Generate, G）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_i = A_i \\cdot B_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当两个输入都为 1 时产生进位</li>\n<li><strong>传播信号（Propagate, P）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_i = A_i \\oplus B_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当输入不同时传播来自低位的进位</li>\n<li><strong>进位输出</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{i+1} = G_i + P_i \\cdot C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>进位链中每级的延迟仅约 20-40 ps（通过专用互联线直连），远小于通用互联的数百 ps 延迟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"进位链性能对比\">进位链性能对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>32 位加法器延迟</th>\n<th>资源消耗</th>\n<th>最大工作频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯 LUT 级联</td>\n<td>~15 ns</td>\n<td>32 LUT</td>\n<td>~65 MHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进位链实现</td>\n<td>~1.5 ns</td>\n<td>8 LUT + 进位链</td>\n<td>~600 MHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DSP Slice</td>\n<td>~3 ns</td>\n<td>1 DSP48</td>\n<td>~500 MHz</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>进位链实现相比纯 LUT 方案性能提升约 10 倍，这就是为什么综合工具在检测到算术运算时会自动推断使用进位链。</p>\n<h3 id=\"进位链的级联\">进位链的级联</h3><p>同一列的 Slice 可以通过专用进位线级联，实现任意宽度的算术运算：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单个 Slice 的 4 个 LUT 支持 4 位宽的进位链</li>\n<li>同一 CLB 的 2 个 Slice 级联支持 8 位宽</li>\n<li>跨 CLB 级联无额外延迟开销（垂直方向的专用进位线）</li>\n<li>典型的 64 位加法器需要 16 个 LUT + 4 个 Slice 的进位链级联</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"hdl-编码对-lut-和进位链的影响\">HDL 编码对 LUT 和进位链的影响</h2><p>综合工具能否有效利用进位链和 LUT 资源，高度依赖 HDL 代码的编写方式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"推断进位链的代码模式\">推断进位链的代码模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 自动推断进位链 — 使用 + 运算符&#10;wire [31:0] sum = a + b + cin;&#10;&#10;// 自动推断进位链 — 比较运算&#10;wire greater = (a &gt; b);&#10;&#10;// 自动推断进位链 — 计数器&#10;reg [15:0] counter;&#10;always @(posedge clk)&#10;    counter &lt;= counter + 1&#39;b1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 自动推断进位链 — 使用 + 运算符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wire [31:0] sum = a + b + cin;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 自动推断进位链 — 比较运算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wire greater = (a > b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 自动推断进位链 — 计数器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reg [15:0] counter;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    counter &#x3C;= counter + 1'b1;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"阻碍进位链推断的代码模式\">阻碍进位链推断的代码模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 手动逐位实现 — 无法推断进位链&#10;genvar i;&#10;generate&#10;    for (i = 0; i &lt; 32; i = i + 1) begin&#10;        assign sum[i] = a[i] ^ b[i] ^ carry[i];&#10;        assign carry[i+1] = (a[i] &amp; b[i]) | (carry[i] &amp; (a[i] ^ b[i]));&#10;    end&#10;endgenerate\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 手动逐位实现 — 无法推断进位链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>genvar i;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>generate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (i = 0; i &#x3C; 32; i = i + 1) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assign sum[i] = a[i] ^ b[i] ^ carry[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assign carry[i+1] = (a[i] &#x26; b[i]) | (carry[i] &#x26; (a[i] ^ b[i]));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>endgenerate</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"资源利用优化建议\">资源利用优化建议</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐做法</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加/减法</td>\n<td>直接使用 +/- 运算符</td>\n<td>综合工具自动映射到进位链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宽比较器</td>\n<td>使用关系运算符</td>\n<td>比较操作映射为减法+进位链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小型常数乘法</td>\n<td>用移位+加法表达</td>\n<td>节省 DSP 资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂逻辑</td>\n<td>减少单个 always 块中的条件嵌套</td>\n<td>避免过深的 LUT 级联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小容量存储</td>\n<td>明确使用分布式 RAM 推断模式</td>\n<td>减少 BRAM 占用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"lut-利用率分析\">LUT 利用率分析</h2><p>FPGA 的实际逻辑容量不仅取决于 LUT 总数，还取决于利用率。实际项目中 LUT 利用率通常在 60-80% 之间为最佳：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>&lt; 50%</strong>：资源浪费，可以选择更小的器件降低成本</li>\n<li><strong>60-75%</strong>：理想范围，布线工具有充分的灵活性</li>\n<li><strong>75-85%</strong>：可接受，但时序收敛可能变困难</li>\n<li><strong>&gt; 85%</strong>：布线拥塞风险高，时序违例概率大幅上升</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这是因为当 LUT 利用率过高时，布线工具被迫使用更长的互联线段绕路，增加了路径延迟和时钟偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LUT 是把真值表存进 SRAM 的可编程查找结构，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 输入 LUT 存储 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 位、可实现任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 变量函数，查表延迟固定。</li>\n<li>从 LUT4 到 LUT6 的演进压缩了级联深度，LUT6 还可分裂为双 LUT5 输出，或（在 SLICEM 中）用作分布式 RAM/移位寄存器。</li>\n<li>进位链是为进位传播设计的专用路径，用生成/传播信号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{i+1} = G_i + P_i \\cdot C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每级延迟仅 20-40 ps。</li>\n<li>32 位加法器用进位链比纯 LUT 级联快约 10 倍，综合工具会自动把算术运算映射到进位链。</li>\n<li>HDL 写法直接决定推断结果：使用 <code>+</code>/<code>-</code>/比较等运算符可推断进位链，手动逐位展开反而会阻断推断。</li>\n<li>LUT 利用率建议控制在 60-80%，过高会导致布线拥塞与时序收敛困难。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"查找表与进位链","id":"查找表与进位链"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"LUT 深入解析","id":"lut-深入解析"},{"level":3,"text":"LUT 的本质：可编程真值表","id":"lut-的本质-可编程真值表"},{"level":3,"text":"从 LUT4 到 LUT6 的演进","id":"从-lut4-到-lut6-的演进"},{"level":3,"text":"LUT6 的双输出模式","id":"lut6-的双输出模式"},{"level":3,"text":"LUT 作为分布式 RAM","id":"lut-作为分布式-ram"},{"level":2,"text":"进位链（Carry Chain）","id":"进位链-carry-chain"},{"level":3,"text":"算术运算的瓶颈","id":"算术运算的瓶颈"},{"level":3,"text":"进位链结构","id":"进位链结构"},{"level":3,"text":"进位链性能对比","id":"进位链性能对比"},{"level":3,"text":"进位链的级联","id":"进位链的级联"},{"level":2,"text":"HDL 编码对 LUT 和进位链的影响","id":"hdl-编码对-lut-和进位链的影响"},{"level":3,"text":"推断进位链的代码模式","id":"推断进位链的代码模式"},{"level":3,"text":"阻碍进位链推断的代码模式","id":"阻碍进位链推断的代码模式"},{"level":3,"text":"资源利用优化建议","id":"资源利用优化建议"},{"level":2,"text":"LUT 利用率分析","id":"lut-利用率分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"FPGA 内部结构详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-architecture/fpga-internal-structure"},"next":{"title":"片上资源详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-architecture/on-chip-resources"}}